OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after US strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FOil prices reached $100.19 a barrel on
OL,7,FWednesday after the US hit five Iranian
OL,8,Ftankers in reprisal strikes after
OL,9,FTehran targeted one of its warships.
OL,11,FBrent crude - which is the global
OL,12,Fbenchmark for prices - has not been as
OL,13,Fexpensive since the end of July, when a
OL,14,Fceasefire between Iran and the US
OL,15,Fcollapsed.
OL,17,FIt did dip back down to $99.90 a
OL,18,Fbarrel, but any fresh flare-ups in the
OL,19,FMiddle East could see it pushed higher
OL,20,Fagain.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
