OL,3,AOil hits $100 a barrel for first time
OL,4,Asince July after US strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US strikes on the five Iranian
OL,7,Ftankers saw four in the Gulf of Oman
OL,8,Flinked to Iran's Revolutionary Guards
OL,9,FCorps (IRGC) hit as well as another
OL,10,Fnear Kharg Island.
